==English==
===Intransitive verb===
'''tattle'''
#{{pejorative}} To [[report]] others' [[wrongdoing]]s or [[violations]]; to [[tell on]] somebody; to provide [[incriminating]] information.

===Noun===
'''tattle''' 
#A [[tattletale]].
#[[Gossip]]; idle talk.

